1
00:00:05,060 --> 00:00:05,545
Hello...

2
00:00:05,545 --> 00:00:07,730
motor insurance department...

3
00:00:07,730 --> 00:00:08,677
Oh hello...

4
00:00:08,677 --> 00:00:11,600
I'd like to ask about insurance for my car.

5
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:12,892
Yes, of course.

6
00:00:12,892 --> 00:00:15,478
I'll just take a few details.

7
00:00:15,478 --> 00:00:16,770
What's your name?

8
00:00:16,770 --> 00:00:18,240
Patrick Jones.

9
00:00:18,240 --> 00:00:20,000
And your address?

10
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:22,290
It's 27 Bank Road.

11
00:00:22,290 --> 00:00:24,553
27 Bank Road.

12
00:00:24,553 --> 00:00:27,570
Is that in Greendale?

13
00:00:27,570 --> 00:00:28,220
Yes.

14
00:00:28,220 --> 00:00:31,060
And what's your daytime phone number?

15
00:00:31,060 --> 00:00:35,950
My work number is 730453.

16
00:00:35,950 --> 00:00:39,430
And could I ask what your occupation is?

17
00:00:39,430 --> 00:00:40,360
Dentist.

18
00:00:40,360 --> 00:00:40,940
OK...

19
00:00:40,940 --> 00:00:45,000
now a few details about your car...

20
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:47,900
What size is the engine?

21
00:00:47,900 --> 00:00:49,880
It's 1200 CCS.

22
00:00:49,880 --> 00:00:50,931
Thank you...

23
00:00:50,931 --> 00:00:53,560
and the make and model?

24
00:00:53,560 --> 00:00:55,490
It's a Hewton Sable.

25
00:00:55,490 --> 00:00:59,170
Could you spell the model name please?

26
00:00:59,170 --> 00:01:01,085
Yes...

27
00:01:01,085 --> 00:01:03,000
S-A-B-L-E.

28
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:04,984
Ah yes.., thanks.

29
00:01:04,984 --> 00:01:08,290
And when was it made?

30
00:01:08,290 --> 00:01:09,910
1997.

31
00:01:09,910 --> 00:01:10,626
Lovely...

32
00:01:10,626 --> 00:01:11,341
right...

33
00:01:11,341 --> 00:01:16,350
I presume you've had a previous insurer?

34
00:01:16,350 --> 00:01:17,000
Yes.

35
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:17,415
Right...

36
00:01:17,415 --> 00:01:21,150
we need to know the name of the company.

37
00:01:21,150 --> 00:01:21,832
Yes...

38
00:01:21,832 --> 00:01:24,560
it was Northern Star.

39
00:01:24,560 --> 00:01:25,509
Thank you,

40
00:01:25,509 --> 00:01:31,200
and have you made any insurance claims in the last five years?

41
00:01:31,200 --> 00:01:32,228
Yes...

42
00:01:32,228 --> 00:01:35,310
one in 1999.

43
00:01:35,310 --> 00:01:37,060
And what was the problem?

44
00:01:37,060 --> 00:01:38,702
It was stolen...

45
00:01:38,702 --> 00:01:39,250
but...

46
00:01:39,250 --> 00:01:40,638
That's fine, Mr Jones...

47
00:01:40,638 --> 00:01:43,760
that's all we need to know at the moment...

48
00:01:43,760 --> 00:01:48,000
And will there be any other named drivers?

49
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:49,150
Just the one...

50
00:01:49,150 --> 00:01:51,100
And his name?

51
00:01:51,100 --> 00:01:52,870
Simon Paynter.

52
00:01:52,870 --> 00:01:56,200
Could you spell the surname please?

53
00:01:56,200 --> 00:02:00,800
P-A-Y-N-T-E-R.

54
00:02:00,800 --> 00:02:02,759
OK thank you...

55
00:02:02,759 --> 00:02:07,330
And what relationship is he to you?

56
00:02:07,330 --> 00:02:09,000
He's my brother-in-law.

57
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:14,000
And what will you or Mr Paynter be using the car for?

58
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:14,754
Well...

59
00:02:14,754 --> 00:02:17,770
mainly for social use...

60
00:02:17,770 --> 00:02:19,338
Social use (murmuring).

61
00:02:19,338 --> 00:02:24,040
Will you be using it to travel to work?

62
00:02:24,040 --> 00:02:26,905
Yes...

63
00:02:26,905 --> 00:02:29,770
sometimes.

64
00:02:29,770 --> 00:02:31,500
...Anything else?

65
00:02:31,500 --> 00:02:32,050
No.

66
00:02:32,050 --> 00:02:33,150
That's it...

67
00:02:33,150 --> 00:02:34,120
And finally...

68
00:02:34,120 --> 00:02:38,000
when would you like to start the insurance?

69
00:02:38,000 --> 00:02:40,600
I'll need it from the 31st of January.

70
00:02:40,600 --> 00:02:41,121
Right...

71
00:02:41,121 --> 00:02:42,164
Mr Jones...

72
00:02:42,164 --> 00:02:48,421
I'm getting a couple of quotes coming up on the computer now...

73
00:02:48,421 --> 00:02:55,200
and the best bet looks like being with a company called Red Flag.

74
00:02:55,200 --> 00:02:55,860
Yeah.

75
00:02:55,860 --> 00:03:01,600
And that comes out at $450 per year...

76
00:03:01,600 --> 00:03:01,994
Well...

77
00:03:01,994 --> 00:03:03,178
that seems OK...

78
00:03:03,178 --> 00:03:07,910
it's quite a bit lower than I've been paying up to now...

79
00:03:07,910 --> 00:03:08,269
Great...

80
00:03:08,269 --> 00:03:11,860
so would you like me to go ahead with that?

81
00:03:11,860 --> 00:03:12,290
Sure...

82
00:03:12,290 --> 00:03:13,150
why not?

83
00:03:13,150 --> 00:03:15,560
How would you like to pay?
